"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksTitle": "AWA Hamwe ikora gute?",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksDescription": "Menya uko iyi porogaramu igufasha gufasha uwo mubana mu kubaha ibanga ryiwe.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph1": "AWA Hamwe igufasha kubona gusa amakuru uwo mubana yahisemwo kugusangiza.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph2": "Nk’urugero, ushobora kubona amakuru amwe y’uruziga rwiwe, imihango yiwe izoza, canke igihe ciwe c’ubushobozi bwo gusama igihe gusangiza vyafunguwe.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph3": "Amakuru agaragara ahora ashingiye ku vyo yahisemwo. Ashobora guhindura ivyo asangiza igihe cose.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoTitle": "Kubera iki amakuru amwe yahishwe?",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoDescription": "Uwo mubana ahitamwo ivyo agusangiza. Ashobora guhindura ivyo yahisemwo igihe cose.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoParagraph1": "Uwo mubana aguma afise ijambo ku makuru ashaka kugusangiza.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoParagraph2": "Nimba amakuru adagaragara aho uri, bishobora kuba bivuga gusa ko atahisemwo kuyagusangiza.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoParagraph3": "Ivyo ahisemwo bishobora guhinduka igihe cose. AWA Hamwe iguhishurira gusa amakuru ushobora kubona none.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.understandingTitle": "Gusobanukirwa amakuru asangizwa",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.understandingDescription": "Insobanuro zoroshe z’umusi w’uruziga, igice arimwo, igihe c’ubushobozi bwo gusama, ovulation igereranijwe n’imihango izoza.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.understandingIntro": "Ngivyo amakuru agusangizwa ashobora kuvuga:",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termCycleDay": "Umusi w’uruziga",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionCycleDay": "Werekana umubare w’iminsi kuva imihango yiwe iheruka yatangura.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termCurrentPhase": "Igice ariko ubu",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionCurrentPhase": "Cerekana igice c’uruziga arimwo ubu igihe kiboneka.",
